{"item_id": "e4cc3d6c6c7bdbde", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "【视频播客】裁员潮下，互联网人该不该做独立开发？", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wHWo6ZEun", "project_url": null, "author": "熠辉IndieDev", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/39930228", "published_at": "2026-11-13T08:00:00+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-17T11:11:55+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "离开大厂，靠自己的产品能养活自己吗？这期结合我两年半独立开发的真实经历，聊聊 AI 时代互联网人的机会、工程师的优势，以及从找需求、做产品到获客赚钱的思路。也分享我为什么从内容变现转向做产品，以及「给 Agent 做产品」这个值得探索的方向。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 21850, "danmaku": 7, "favorites": 1230}, "tags": ["VibeCoding", "上B站看播客", "视频播客", "AI"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1wHWo6ZEun", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wHWo6ZEun", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261117T110909"}
