{"item_id": "0c1a6d3f2e3f5140", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "做了个新项目，我要出海了！", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mAAmzqEfP", "project_url": null, "author": "程序员鱼皮", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/12890453", "published_at": "2026-02-27T12:55:15+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-17T11:11:56+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "我用 AI 编程开发了 GitHub 文档翻译平台，让你的开源项目轻松出海。项目全程直播开发，99% 以上的代码都是 AI 写的，代码已开源！\n编程学习教程+实战项目+简历模板：codefather.cn\n视频详细讲解了如何用 Cursor 搭配 MCP 插件和 Agent Skills，用 AI 完成需求调研、方案设计、前后端并行开发、测试验收到部署上线的全流程。技术栈涵盖 Next.js 全栈开发、TypeScript、Prisma、MySQL 数据库、GitHub App 安全授权、OpenRout", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 91148, "danmaku": 112, "favorites": 4714}, "tags": ["科技猎手", "Cursor", "AI编程", "AI", "编程", "GitHub", "大模型", "软件应用", "计算机", "教程"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1mAAmzqEfP", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mAAmzqEfP", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261117T110909"}
{"item_id": "9da893e06d4b9e78", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "失踪人口回归！我的第一个出海产品，是怎样冷启动赚到第一个 100 美元的？", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kBQeYiEpv", "project_url": "https://tailwindresume.co/", "author": "独立开发者Viking", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/480241067", "published_at": "2025-03-17T09:13:22+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-17T11:11:56+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "失踪人口回归！去年九月份我当爸爸了，我们夫妻两人独立带娃，时间少了很多，所以更新频率降低了很多，在今年 2 月份还是完成了人生一个里程碑的事件，我的第一个出海产品，简单简历的英文版：TailwindResume https://tailwindresume.co/ 正式上线了。直接说结论，我通过冷启动的方式在两周内收获 50 个用户，赚到了 100 美元，不是特别惊人，所以非常真实，是每个想出海的独立开发者都可以完全复制的经验，下面是整个过程的记录。\n\n文字版：https://vikingz.me/fir", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 10843, "danmaku": 2, "favorites": 712}, "tags": ["AI IN ALL！", "出海", "全栈开发", "一人公司", "编程", "自由职业", "独立开发", "前端开发"], "links": ["https://tailwindresume.co/", "https://vikingz.me/fir"], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1kBQeYiEpv", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kBQeYiEpv", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261117T110909"}
